# RF-COMP-05 static numerical readiness review

Decision: accepted for the single registered qualification, with no static blocker found. This is source review only; observed byte/error parity, timing, resource use and actual qualification remain pending. No candidate/test imports, test execution, serializer calls or scientific work were performed for this review. Reviewer authored the independent test file and discloses that scope; the candidate and qualification driver have other authors.

